00_AQIdke9P8McZwNukS2wrCz0fQCC6ijHxTJH1Zk29H-SJIw&oe=6AA2BD6F"}, {"file_name": "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 2026-01-19 035054.png", "id": "1228477608613963", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1228477611947296_6570017654452216561_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_MVDdL4uJWMQ7kNvwEI6N3n&_nc_oc=AdreFbJyY5iuEIpMpSbvbItbin4ihJRejFWeSL0p95LRtW0qSPVvphTq4_iXNnuxLfU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJutVUVD9NG3tYi76eoEM2noatKnRFmrE6I2C6XZS3kZw&oe=6AA2A119"}, {"file_name": "Ekran g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcs\u00fc 2026-01-12 022553.png", "id": "2112509839494590", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818885_2112509842827923_4135931838776649494_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j10BP2RBSLoQ7kNvwGDFXu4&_nc_oc=AdoSaReYH1hYu6fGhQsh3WM-8wJ9Ts8DJ8M-Q6Lu7J7IpEuTx1Zbe44eAXMjUCK39js&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJWlcR_vrSI3b5ZMg8EICL_WrxiIkuivAR-tC53zAzy2w&oe=6AA29E64"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ss1.png", "id": "1074687411455361", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820910_1074687418122027_4915986317356643802_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yb3w5fpUvgYQ7kNvwHYqMAn&_nc_oc=AdqRIDdCAQ4MlWUO0osETunCtj3lefuLYh5JJj6lD0S30QGq002S4q_WDgTRMih9K2s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQItUqvIW0VAPybXG8-0MElNZd1jIkswrzeNHWL2PNEcFw&oe=6AA29D18"}, "display_name": "Race Pro", "keywords": ["Racing", "Sports", "CarRacing", "Casual", "Simulator"], "long_description": "Race Pro is an intense highway racing experience where speed, precision, and quick reactions determine how far you can go.\n\nDrive through busy highways filled with traffic while pushing your car to extreme speeds. The goal is simple: survive as long as possible while earning points by performing risky maneuvers and close passes between vehicles. The closer you drive to other cars, the higher your score becomes.\n\nBut speed comes with danger. As your velocity increases, traffic becomes harder to navigate and every mistake becomes more costly. One wrong move can end your run instantly, so maintaining focus and control is essential.\n\nThe game rewards aggressive driving and confident maneuvering through tight spaces. Skilled players can chain together near misses and high-speed passes to build massive scores.\n\nIn addition to racing, players can customize their vehicles with different paint options, stickers, and visual upgrades, creating a unique style before returning to the highway.\n\nWith fast-paced gameplay, endless highways, and increasing difficulty, Race Pro delivers a thrilling driving experience where every second counts.\n\nPush your limits, dodge the traffic, and see how far you can go in Race Pro.", "short_description": "Race Pro is a high-speed highway racing experience where precision and reflexes are the key to survival. Drive through heavy traffic, perform risky close passes, and push your car to extreme speeds to earn higher scores. The faster you drive, the greater the challenge becomes. Customize your vehicle, master the traffic, and prove your skills on endless highway roads."}]}, "developer_name": "Esti Soft", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_l_GxTpD64zBNaY3TAnGXtCB1cmJE-E7/view", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Esti Soft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.esti.tr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_p